 are in the  Black Widow program so she goes back and  we can tell that taskmaster just sends  everybody against her and Natasha asks  her sister how many  others are there in Yelina answers with  enough so it looks like taskmaster is  going to send the whole entire Red Room  against Natasha to try and stop her then  we see Alexei szostak ah've aka red  Guardian breaking out of prison and the  family gets back together we see him  next to Molina and Yelina  and he says we're family we fight  together and he's fully dressed out in  his red Guardian outfit and then the  next scene is him taking on taskmaster  and we see a lot here now if we go back  to the beginning of the trailer we can  see taskmaster looking at footage of  Black Widow fighting this is what  taskmaster does his skill is that he can  manipulate anybody's fighting technique  just by watching them so he can mimic  not only black widows fighting style but  any other avenger that he might have  seen and we see that in this trailer in  the beginning when he's holding the  shield he's clearly mimicking Captain  America's fighting style we then see him  fight red Guardian and he pulls out  claws and his finger tips just like  black panther identical to his and while  he's fighting red Guardian he's  spider-man kicks him does a backflip and  lands just like Natasha would land so  it's been revealed and we can clearly  tell that taskmaster knows how Natasha  fights because he's been studying  footage of her and since he's been  studying footage of her he's definitely  looked at footage of all of the other  Avengers fighting styles as well and now  he can fight just like them so it's  almost like Natasha is going to be  taking on all of her other fellow  Avengers their fighting styles at least  in this movie including Hawkeye there's  a scene where Natasha and Yelena are  trying to get away  Natasha seems to be driving pretty  poorly as you Lena tells her that her  plan sucks but then we see taskmasters  tank a huge armored vehicle shows up and  we see taskmaster pop out of the top of  it with a bow and arrow in hand just  like Hawkeye so again it's kind of like  she's fighting her friends all of the  Avengers that she's fought alongside  with over the years and that's kind of  going to be the point of taskmaster  being this villain we've heard Natasha  say in each one of the trailers and TV  spots that we've gotten so far for this  movie that she was an Avenger she went  off and she got a new family and in this  movie she's going to have to team up  with her old family to take on  taskmaster who fights like all of the  Avengers now there is one key scene here  at the end of the trailer that we have  to talk about because it is important  Alexey in full red Guardian uniform  which of course  is the Russian version of their Captain  America he kicks up taskmaster shield  just like Steve Rogers does and he  throws it basically through the window  of a Helicarrier that taskmaster is  trying to get in and in this scene if we  slow it down we can clearly tell that  Malina is the person who is piloting  this Helicarrier and this is important  because it was widely believed that  Malina is taskmaster that she is the one  that is actually in charge of the Red  Room and this seems to be the first  scene that we can clearly tell that  taskmaster and Malina are in one scene  together so although it is still  possible because in the comics there are  multiple versions of taskmaster it  doesn't seem likely that Malina is task  master we end this with an awesome scene  between Natasha and taskmaster fighting  where he pulls out a sword and he kind  of does this in a way like Natasha pulls  out one of her batons so again she's  going to be fighting taskmaster and he's  going to have a lot of different  fighting styles but he's going to have  her fighting style  so this movie is going to have a ton of  action a lot of hand hand combat a lot  of shooting and overall looks absolutely  fantastic and I can't wait for it to  come out in May what do you think about  this trailer let me know in the comments  down below and let me know who do you  think taskmaster is drop your answer  down below don't forget to like the  video and subscribe notifications turned  on to stay up to date on all things  relating to Black Widow and the MCU  don't forget to follow me on Instagram  and Twitter and as always thank you all  so much for watching woof woof
 

